{"ID":"20240206101637-n4xz6yn","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240206101637-n4xz6yn","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206101637-n4xz6yn\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206101648-rknczdi\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206101641-e0bupy8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206101648-rknczdi\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":" 木蝴蝶（玉蝴蝶、千张纸）","type":"doc","updated":"20240830101821"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206101648-rknczdi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206101648-rknczdi"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产云南、广西、贵州等地。\n【性状】\t本品为蝶形薄片，除基部外三面延长成宽大菲薄的翅。长58cm，宽3.54.5cm。表面浅黄白色，翅半透明，有绢丝样光泽，上有放射状纹理，边缘多破裂。体轻，剥去种皮，可见一层薄膜状的胚乳紧裹于子叶之外。子叶2，蝶形，黄绿色或黄色，长径1"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.5cm。无臭，味微苦。\n【性味】\t苦、甘，凉。\n【功效】\t清肺利咽，疏肝和胃。用于肺热咳嗽，喉痹，音哑，肝胃气痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240206101641-e0bupy8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206101641-e0bupy8","updated":"20240206101641"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206101641-rweb3jr.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240708141104-avmie2p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240708141104-avmie2p","updated":"20240708141417"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 631px;","style":"width: 621px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"木蝴蝶6"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/木蝴蝶6-20240708141415-mcgi70h.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 621px;\" parent-style=\"width: 631px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240708131644-p8zvqcl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240708131644-p8zvqcl","updated":"20240708140318"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 371px;","style":"width: 361px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240708131644-ph5izlz.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 361px;\" parent-style=\"width: 371px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240708140755-88w8rqq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240708140755-88w8rqq","updated":"20240829173301"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 746px;","style":"width: 736px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240708140731-nocd9zx.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 736px;\" parent-style=\"width: 746px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240708140755-gfi80qn.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240708140358-rnqye4n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240708140358-rnqye4n","updated":"20240829173305"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240708141902-s8fu9jw.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 506px;","style":"width: 496px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"木蝴蝶1"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/木蝴蝶1-20240708133653-u2v4eqv.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 496px;\" parent-style=\"width: 506px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240708133758-uhg1a50","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240708133758-uhg1a50","updated":"20240829173306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 642px;","style":"width: 632px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"木蝴蝶3"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/木蝴蝶3-20240708133758-jqfx7wn.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 632px;\" parent-style=\"width: 642px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 505px;","style":"width: 495px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"木蝴蝶8"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/木蝴蝶8-20240708143910-k6t58sv.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 495px;\" parent-style=\"width: 505px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240708143923-aklai4f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240708143923-aklai4f","updated":"20240829174905"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 601px;","style":"width: 591px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"木蝴蝶"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/木蝴蝶-20240829174905-9dof9to.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 591px;\" parent-style=\"width: 601px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 674px;","style":"width: 664px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"木蝴蝶5"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/木蝴蝶5-20240708134435-vpq23zr.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 664px;\" parent-style=\"width: 674px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240829175518-f7ploe7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240829175518-f7ploe7","updated":"20240829175518"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 539px;","style":"width: 529px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"木蝴蝶 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/木蝴蝶 2-20240829175518-4frkknw.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 529px;\" parent-style=\"width: 539px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 520px;","style":"width: 510px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"木蝴蝶2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/木蝴蝶2-20240708133925-ouwkgpf.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 510px;\" parent-style=\"width: 520px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240708134435-r51qdiu","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240708134435-r51qdiu"}},{"ID":"20240830101812-h7u1fbt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-h7u1fbt","updated":"20240830101821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中草药：木蝴蝶"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-uxtr75f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-uxtr75f","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"木蝴蝶《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-jd5j63z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-jd5j63z","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】MùHúDié"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-gely7ih","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-gely7ih","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】本品为紫葳科植物木蝴蝶Oroxylumindicum（L.）Vent.的干燥成熟种子。秋、冬二季采收成熟果实，曝晒至果实开裂，取出种子，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-0czcnmu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-0czcnmu","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】本品为蝶形薄片，除基部外三面延长成宽大菲薄的翅。长5～8cm，宽3.5～4.5cm。表面浅黄白色，翅半透明，有绢丝样光泽，上有放射状纹理，边缘多破裂。体轻，剥去种皮，可见一层薄膜状的胚乳紧裹于子叶之外。子叶2，蝶形，黄绿色或黄色，长径1～1.5cm。无臭，味微苦。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-2svalr7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-2svalr7","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【鉴别】"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-edh2gou","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-edh2gou","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（1）本品粉末黄色或黄绿色。种翅细胞长纤维状，壁波状增厚，直径20～40μｍ；胚乳细胞多角形，壁呈念珠状增厚。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-gp4pwz7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-gp4pwz7","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）取本品粉末2g，加乙醇30ml，加热回流15分钟，滤过，滤液加硼酸0.5g使溶解，滤过，滤液作为供试品溶液。另取黄芩苷对照品，加乙醇制成每1ml含1mg的溶液，作为对照品溶液。照薄层色谱法（附录ⅥB）试验，吸取上述两种溶液各10μl,分别点于同一硅胶Ｇ薄层板上，以正丁醇－醋酸－水（6:1.5:2.5）为展开剂，展开，取出，晾干。供试品色谱中，在与对照品色谱相应的位置上，显相同颜色的斑点。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-mbeqpws","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-mbeqpws","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】苦、甘，凉。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-exwki18","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-exwki18","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】归肺、肝、胃经。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-a7svxby","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-a7svxby","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】清肺利咽，疏肝和胃。用于肺热咳嗽，喉痹，音哑，肝胃气痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-sokr65w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-sokr65w","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】1.5～3g。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-fb5sfti","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-fb5sfti","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【贮藏】置通风干燥处。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-22dbelq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-22dbelq","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-yzfar9m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-yzfar9m","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"木蝴蝶《全国中草药汇编》"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-5spmqai","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-5spmqai","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】MùHúDié"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-aenbzu0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-aenbzu0","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】千层纸、千张纸、破布子、满天飞"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-ez9i6zz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-ez9i6zz","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】紫葳科植物木蝴蝶Oroxylumindicum（L.）Vent.，以种子、树皮入药。秋季种子成熟时，摘取蒴果，晒干，剥出种子；树皮随用随采。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-ib4hyl3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-ib4hyl3","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-qr4l37f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-qr4l37f","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"种子：清肺热，利咽喉，止咳，止痛。用于急性咽喉炎，声音嘶哑，支气管炎，百日咳，胃痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-h9yn4iw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-h9yn4iw","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"树皮：清热利湿。用于传染性肝炎，膀胱炎。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-b3p9quh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-b3p9quh","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】种子1～3钱，树皮0.5～1两"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-5kpksz0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-5kpksz0","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《全国中草药汇编》"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-v5r9mbm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-v5r9mbm","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"木蝴蝶《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-hiyalsx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-hiyalsx","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】《纲目拾遗》"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-a2w8ef4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-a2w8ef4","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】MùHúDié"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-8zcl7az","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-8zcl7az","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】千张纸、兜铃、三百两银药（《滇南本草》），玉蝴蝶（《张聿青医案》），云故纸（《兽医常用中药》），破布子、白故子、海船果心（《中药形性经验鉴别法》），白玉纸（《中药志》），白干层、纸肉、故纸、洋故纸、鸭船层纸（《广西中药志》），海船皮（《四川中药志》），千纸肉（《岭南草药志》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-5loddhg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-5loddhg","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】为紫葳科植物木蝴蝶的干燥成熟种子。10～12月采摘成熟果实，取出种子，晒干或烘干。置干燥处。受潮则易发霉或生黑色斑点。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-z0qxwc0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-z0qxwc0","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-9q7ru76","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-9q7ru76","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"木蝴蝶，又名：朝简、老鸦船。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-1wzfznq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-1wzfznq","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大乔木，高7.5～12米，树皮厚。叶对生，很大，2～3回羽状复叶，长40～160厘米，宽20～80厘米；小叶片卵形或椭圆形，长6～14厘米，宽4.5～9厘米，先端短尖或渐尖，基部圆形或斜形，全缘，上面绿色，下面淡绿色；小叶柄长5～10毫米。总状花序顶生；总花柄长约30厘米；花萼肉质，钟形；花冠大，钟形，淡紫色，先端5浅裂；雄蕊5，稍伸出花冠外，花丝基部被棉毛，第5雄蕊花丝较其他4枚稍短；花盘大，肉质；柱头2裂，半圆形板状。蒴果下垂，扁平，阔线形，长30～90厘米，宽5～8厘米，先端短尖，基部楔形，边缘稍内弯似船形，中央有一条略微突出的背缝；果爿木质，成熟后沿腹缝裂开。种子多数，为半透明的膜质翅所包围而成很薄的片状体。花期7～8月。果期10～12月。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-uwge1qf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-uwge1qf","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】生长山坡、溪边、山谷及灌木丛中。分布福建、广西、云南、贵州、四川、广东等地。主产云南、广西、贵州。此外，福建，广东、四川凉山彝族自治州亦产少量。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-sainexu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-sainexu","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】种子类椭圆形，扁平而菲薄.外种皮除基部外，三边延长成宽大的翅，呈半透明薄膜状，淡棕白色，有绢样光泽，并有放射状纹理，边缘多破碎。连翅种子长径约5.5～8厘米，短径3.5～4厘米.除去翅后，种子长径约2～3厘米，短径约1.5～2厘米。剥去膜质的外种皮后可见一层薄膜状的胚乳，紧裹于子叶之外。珠柄线形，黑棕色，着生于基部。子叶2枚，黄绿色，扁平，蝶形，质脆，胚根明显。气无，味微苦。以干燥，色白、大而完整者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-hd6lr80","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-hd6lr80","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-wvuhos3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-wvuhos3","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦，寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-g99uf37","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-g99uf37","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《岭南采药录》：\"味酸苦。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-6ugv5lo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-6ugv5lo","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《药材资料汇编》：\"味苦，寒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-au1aegn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-au1aegn","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《广西中药志》：\"味甘淡，性凉，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-yih6ikm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-yih6ikm","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-hv3fg3l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-hv3fg3l","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"入肺、肝经。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-1zj5ovu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-1zj5ovu","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《滇南本草》：\"入肺、脾、胃经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-r8r0ih1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-r8r0ih1","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《岭南采药录》：\"入肝经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-8ex6n59","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-8ex6n59","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-m876783","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-m876783","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"润肺，舒肝，和胃，生肌。治咳嗽，喉痹，音哑，肝胃气痛，疮口不敛。治干咳不止常配夏枯草。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-ci5d1ni","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-ci5d1ni","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《云南通志》：\"焚为灰，可治心气痛。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-5rx32ff","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-5rx32ff","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《滇南本草》：\"定喘，消痰，破蛊积，除血蛊、气蛊之毒。又能补虚，宽中，进食。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-a92ykel","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-a92ykel","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《纲目拾遗》：\"治心气痛，肝气痛，下部湿热。又项秋子云，凡痈毒不收口，以此贴之。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-nurgmn4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-nurgmn4","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《岭南采药录》：\"消痰火，除眼热。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-zxpu55o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-zxpu55o","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《现代实用中药》：\"镇咳，治百日咳及干性气管炎。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-tw7nd7m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-tw7nd7m","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《药材资料汇编》：\"治咽喉失音。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-q188rdb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-q188rdb","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦广州部队《常用中草药手册》：\"清肺热，利咽喉。治急慢性支气管炎，肺结核咳嗽，咽喉肿痛，扁桃体炎。\""}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-z1nyw8l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-z1nyw8l","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，2～3钱；或研末。外用：敷贴。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-dh0tevi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-dh0tevi","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【贮藏】置通风干燥处。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-7zekgs2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-7zekgs2","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【附方】"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-5yajfq8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-5yajfq8","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①治急性气管炎、百日咳等：木蝴蝶一钱，安南子三钱，桔梗一钱五分，甘草一钱，桑白皮三钱，款冬花三钱。水煎，加冰糖三两，溶化于药液，制成糖浆，一日数回，频频服之。（《现代实用中药》止咳糖浆）"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-ak7kine","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-ak7kine","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治肝气痛：木蝴蝶二、三十张，铜铫上焙燥研细，好酒调服。（《纲目拾遗》）"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-0u10f7f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-0u10f7f","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-36x80gb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-36x80gb","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"木蝴蝶《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-z0go0dw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-z0go0dw","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】出自《本草纲目拾遗》"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-olyq5wi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-olyq5wi","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】MùHúDié"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-lh7usdm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-lh7usdm","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】IndianTrumetflowerSeed,SeedofIndianTrumetflower"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-bd7uqwy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-bd7uqwy","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】千张纸、兜铃、磊刀树、三百两银药、玉蝴蝶、云故纸、破布子、白故纸、海船果心、白玉纸、白千层、纸肉、故纸、洋故纸、鸭船层纸、千纸肉、海船皮、满天飞"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-frfjl64","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-frfjl64","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-fxqoqr9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-fxqoqr9","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为紫葳科植物木蝴蝶的成熟种子。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-5v70uwn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-5v70uwn","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Oraxylumindicum(L.)Kurz[Bignon-iaindicaL.]"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-j8os3n2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-j8os3n2","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：秋、冬季采收成熟果实，曝晒至果实开裂，取出种子，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-wbx2ivw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-wbx2ivw","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】木蝴蝶木乔木，高7-12m。树皮厚，有皮孔。小枝皮孔极多而突起，叶痕明显而大。叶对生；大型奇数二至四回羽状复叶，着生于茎干近顶端，长60-160cm，宽20-80cm；小叶多数，小叶柄长5-10mm，小叶片三角状卵形，长6-14cm，宽4-9cm，先端短渐尖，基部圆形或宽楔形而偏斜，全缘，上面绿色，下面淡绿色，两面无毛，干后发蓝色。总状聚伞花序顶生，长40-150cm，花梗长约7cm；花萼钟状，长2.2-4.5cm，宽2-3cm，紫色，先商平截，宿存；花冠橙红色，肉质，长3-9cm，钟形，直径5-8.5cm，先端5浅裂，裂片大小不等；雄蕊5，插生于花冠筒中部，伸出于花冠外；花丝基部被绵毛，其中1花丝较短；花盘磊，肉质；花柱长5-7cm，柱头2片开裂。蒴果木质，扁平，阔线形，下垂，长40-120cm，宽5-8.5cm，先端短尖，基部楔形，边缘稍内弯，中间有一条微突出的背缝，成熟时棕黄色，沿腹缝线裂开，果瓣具中肋。种子多数，种子连翅长6-7.5cm，宽3.5-4cm，除基部外，全被白色半透明的薄翅包围。花期7-10月，果期10-12月。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-1b9c12f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-1b9c12f","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-7qbkss5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-7qbkss5","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生态环境：生长于海拔1000以下的山坡、溪边、山谷或灌木丛中。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-8s4uidg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-8s4uidg","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：分布于福建、台湾、广东、海南、广西、四川、贵州、云南等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-xwqncbd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-xwqncbd","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-8d0nf0x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-8d0nf0x","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状鉴别种子近椭圆形，薄片状，长2-3cm，宽1.5-2cm。表面浅黄白色，有绢丝样光泽。种皮三面向外扩展成宽大的翅，翅宽约2.5cm，呈膜质半透明状，具放射状纹理，边缘多破裂。体轻，剥去种皮，有薄膜状状胚乳紧包子叶。子叶2枚，扁平蝶形，黄绿色或浅黄色，长径约1.5cm，短径约1cm；胚根明显。气微，味微苦。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-zusjk1i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-zusjk1i","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"愉张大、色白、有光泽、翼柔软如绸者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-od2v3o4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-od2v3o4","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴别种子横切面：种皮细胞10余列。胚乳细胞4-10余列。子叶上表皮细胞近方形，下表皮细胞稍小；栅状组织细胞含油滴及叶绿体；海绵组织细胞排列紧密，含油滴及淀粉粒，有维管束分布。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-zks4ji1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-zks4ji1","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"粉末特征：茎黄色或黄绿色。种翅细胞长纤维状，壁波状增厚，直径20-40μm；胚乳细胞多角形，壁呈念珠状增厚。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-2lsnyv5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-2lsnyv5","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"薄层色谱：取本品粉末2g，加乙醇30ml，回流提取15min，滤过，滤液加硼酸0.5g使溶解，滤过，滤液供为供试品溶液。另取黄芩甙对照品，加乙醇制成每1ml含1mg的深液，作为对照品溶液。吸取上述两种溶液各10μl，分别点于同一硅胶G薄层板上，以正丁醇-醋酸-水（6：1.5:2.5）为展开剂，展开，取出，晾干。供试品色谱中，在与对照品色谱相应的位置上，显相同颜色的斑点。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-zp06qu3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-zp06qu3","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-y2iu1e8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-y2iu1e8","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"种子含脂肪油20%，其中油酸占80.4%[1]。又含苯甲酸（benzoicacid），白杨素（chrysin），木蝴蝶甙（oroxin）A、B[2]，黄芩甙元（baicalein），特土甙（tetuin）[3]，5-羟基-6，7二甲氧基黄酮（5-hydroxy-6,7-dimethoxyflavone），木蝴蝶素（oroxylin）A，5，6-二羟基-7-甲氧基黄酮（5，6-dihydroxy-7-methoxyflavone），粗毛豚草素（hispidulin），芹菜素（apigenin），高山黄芩素（scutel-larein），白杨素-7-O-β-D-glucopyra-noside），白杨素-7-O-β-龙胆二糖甙（chrysin-7-O-β-gen-tiobioside），黄芩甙（baicalin），高山黄芩甙（scutellarin）[4]，木蝴蝶定（oroxindin）即汉黄芩素-7-O-β-D-葡萄糖醛酸甙（wogonin-7-O-β-D-glucuronde）[5]。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-m5054w9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-m5054w9","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"叶含黄芩甙元、高山黄芩素、高山黄芩甙[6]。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-ylg003t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-ylg003t","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药理作用】种子、茎皮含黄芩甙元，有抗炎、抗变态反应、利尿、利胆，降胆固醇的作用。种子和茎皮中含白杨素，对人体鼻咽癌（KB）细胞有细胞毒活性，其半数有效量为13mg/ml。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-cf1fxmd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-cf1fxmd","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】味微苦；甘；性微寒"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-iw71t4k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-iw71t4k","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】归肺；肝；胃经"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-e50zc7h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-e50zc7h","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】利咽润肺；疏肝和胃；敛疮生肌。主咽痛喉痹；声音嘶哑；咳嗽；肝胃气痛；疮疡久溃不敛；浸淫疮"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-gdqpebg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-gdqpebg","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，6-9g；研末，1.5-3g。外用：适量，敷贴；或研末撒患处。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-eld00mr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-eld00mr","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【各家论述】"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-85v5lx7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-85v5lx7","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《云南通志》：焚为灰，可治心气痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-qnv4nb1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-qnv4nb1","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《滇南本草》：定喘，消痰，破蛊积，除血蛊、气蛊之毒。又能补虚，宽中，进食。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-jovwo6s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-jovwo6s","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《纲目拾遗》：治心气痛，肝气痛，下部湿热。又项秋子云，凡痈毒不收口，以此贴之。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-tekjzh5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-tekjzh5","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《岭南采药录》：消痰火，除眼热。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-mbkhxzg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-mbkhxzg","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《现代实用中药》：镇咳，治百日咳及干性气管炎。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-qp064y3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-qp064y3","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《药材资料汇编》：治咽喉失音。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-jke6f4g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-jke6f4g","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.广州部队《常用中草药手册》：清肺热，利咽喉。治急慢性支气管炎，肺结核咳嗽，咽喉肿痛，扁桃体炎。"}]},{"ID":"20240830101812-9fq1dw5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101812-9fq1dw5","updated":"20240830101831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240830101814-4r2eedc","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240830101814-4r2eedc","updated":"20240830101831"}},{"ID":"20240830101815-lfe6hb1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830101815-lfe6hb1","updated":"20240830101831"}}]}